              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "h82ck"
            },
            "reviewBody": "As this was so easy, I give it 5 starts compared to the recipe I usually use! Really good and really simple and fast to make. I used tequila lime salsa, so left out the lime and used about 1/2 tbs of chipotle seasoning instead of the adobo sauce. Excellent! Thanks!"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Genevieve"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We didn't exactly make this recipe, as part way in we realized we did not have sour cream, salsa, or lime. But what we ended up with was amazing! We used lemon instead of lime and added a half can of peppers and adobo sauce. I'm not a fan of really spicy food, and this was perfect for me. The peppers added a great flavor with out too much heat!",
            "datePublished": "2010-01-01T18:06:54.697Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
