            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "mommyluvs2cook"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I thought this was great! I did mash the avocado before mixing everything in. Mine isn't the pretty green like the other pictures, it's almost is an unappetizing color actually, but that could be because I added extra adobo sauce. I served mine on lettuce and tomatoes as a type of \"dressing\". Worked well!",
            "datePublished": "2012-08-29T12:51:53.440Z"
          },
