              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "SunnyByrd"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is good. Unless you have super-sensitive taste buds, you will want to increase the adobo sauce. As written, there is a little heat, but not enough of the smoky flavor. I ended up using about a teaspoon, which may be a little hot for some, but was perfectly flavored for us. Thanks for the recipe!",
